      "statement": "Dated observation (as of 2026-09-22, Zhejiang Chunhui Intelligent Control's SZSE inquiry reply): the acquisition target Zhejiang Chunhui Instrument focuses its fuel-cell business on SOFC temperature sensors, has supplied Bloom Energy in volume since 2007, and names Japan's Okazaki Manufacturing as its main competitor at that customer; the reply's table from the intermediaries' interview with Bloom lists Chunhui Instrument at over 70% of Bloom's temperature-sensor purchases with Okazaki as the other supplier. Issuer-side document of a related party (the listed company already holds 38.69% and is acquiring the rest) — L8 weak: no Bloom-side primary names Chunhui Instrument; not a sole-source claim (a second supplier is named).",
